{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_ComM_01090","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_ComM_01090@rel:R21-11#205c5dd3","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_ComM_01090","release":"R21-11","content":"} If ComMPncGatewayEnabled and ComMPncDynamicMappingSupport are set to TRUE and when the PNC Learning Phase is active, then ComM shall forward received ERA Rx information on channels where ComMPncDynamicMappingE nabled is set to TRUE. Therefore, ComM shall set the affected PN bit(s) to the assigned Com signals with ComMPncComSignalDirection “TX” on all other channels where ComMPncDynamicMappingEnabled is set to TRUE.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_COMManager.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-09-30T16:45:22+00:00"},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_ComM_01090@rel:R22-11#84b7d31d","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_ComM_01090","release":"R22-11","content":"If ComMPncGatewayEnabled and ComMPncDynamicMappingSupport are set to TRUE and when the PNC Learning Phase is active, then ComM shall forward received ERA Rx information on channels where ComMPncDynamicMappingEnabled is set to TRUE. ComM shall set the affected PN C bit(s) in all affected ERAn on all other channels wher e ComMPncDynamicMappingEnabled is set to TRUE considering the following rules:  Rx ERA received on channels with ComMPncGatewayType set to COMM_GATEWAY_TYPE_ACTIVE shall be forwarded on all other coordinated channels (active or passive)  Rx ERA received on channel with ComMPncGatewayType set to COMM_GATEWAY_TYPE_PASSIVE shall be forwarded on all other channels where ComMPncGatewayType set to COMM_GATEWAY_TYPE_ACTIVE","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_COMManager.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-09-30T16:45:23+00:00"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_ComM_01090","release":"R23-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_C